    name: 'Akara',
    type: 'Normal Attack',
    icon: '/images/Nahida_Talent_Akara.webp',
    desc: 'Performs up to 4 attacks that deal Dendro DMG to opponents in front of her.\n\n• Charged Attack: Consumes Stamina to deal AoE Dendro DMG to opponents after a short casting time.\n• Plunging Attack: Calling upon the might of Dendro, Nahida plunges towards the ground from mid-air, damaging all opponents in her path and dealing AoE Dendro DMG upon impact.'
  },
  {
    name: 'All Schemes to Know',
    type: 'Elemental Skill',
    icon: '/images/Nahida_Talent_All_Schemes_to_Know.webp',
